{"speciesId":346,"names":{"fr":"Vacilys","es":"Cradily","en":"Cradily","ja":"ユレイドル"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"CRADILY roams around the ocean floor in search of food. This POKéMON freely extends its tree trunk-like neck and captures unwary prey using its eight tentacles."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"CRADILY’s body serves as an anchor, preventing it from being washed away in rough seas. This POKéMON secretes a strong digestive fluid from its tentacles."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It drags its heavy body along the seafloor. It makes its nest in the shallows of warm seas. CRADILY can be seen on beaches when the tide goes out."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It ensnares prey with its eight tentacles. It then melts the prey with a strong acid before feeding."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It ensnares prey with its eight tentacles. It then melts the prey with a strong acid before feeding."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It lives in the shallows of warm seas. When the tide goes out, it digs up prey from beaches."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It lives in the shallows of warm seas. When the tide goes out, it digs up prey from beaches."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It lives in the shallows of warm seas. When the tide goes out, it digs up prey from beaches."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It lives in warm seas. Its heavy body weighs it down so it won’t get washed away in rough weather."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It lives in warm seas. Its heavy body weighs it down so it won’t get washed away in rough weather."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Vit dans les hauts-fonds des mers chaudes. Il déterre sa proie du sable quand la marée se retire."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It lives in the shallows of warm seas. When the tide goes out, it digs up prey from beaches."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Vit dans les hauts-fonds des mers chaudes. Il déterre sa proie du sable quand la marée se retire."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It lives in the shallows of warm seas. When the tide goes out, it digs up prey from beaches."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It lives in the shallows of warm seas. When the tide goes out, it digs up prey from beaches."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It lives in the shallows of warm seas. When the tide goes out, it digs up prey from beaches."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Vit dans les hauts-fonds des mers chaudes. Il déterre sa proie du sable quand la marée se retire."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Vive en el fondo de los mares de aguas templadas. Emerge para cazar cuando baja la marea."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It lives in the shallows of warm seas. When the tide goes out, it digs up prey from beaches."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"暖かい 海の 浅瀬に いる。 潮が 引くと 砂浜に 潜った 獲物を 掘り出して 食べる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Lorsqu’il chasse, Vacilys utilise ses huit tentacules. Il dissout sa proie à l’aide d’un puissant acide avant de l’avaler."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Atrapa a su presa con los ocho tentáculos que tiene y, antes de devorarla, la baña en ácido."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It ensnares prey with its eight tentacles. It then melts the prey with a strong acid before feeding."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"８枚の 触手で 獲物を 絡め取り 強い 消化液で 溶かしてから むしゃむしゃ 食べる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Vacilys erre dans les profondeurs de l’océan pour chercher de la nourriture. Ce Pokémon peut allonger son cou à volonté et capturer ses proies à l’aide de ses huit tentacules."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Cradily va por el fondo oceánico sin rumbo fijo en busca de comida. El cuello de este Pokémon se parece al tronco de un árbol. Cuando quiere atrapar a su presa desprevenida, lo estira y usa los ocho tentáculos que tiene."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Cradily roams around the ocean floor in search of food. This Pokémon freely extends its tree trunk-like neck and captures unwary prey using its eight tentacles."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"海の 底で エサを 探して 歩き回る。 木の 枝の ような 首を 自在に 伸ばして ８枚の 触手で 獲物を 捕まえる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Le corps de Vacilys lui sert d’ancre et l’empêche d’être emporté quand la mer est déchaînée. Les tentacules de ce Pokémon sécrètent un puissant fluide digestif."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"A Cradily le sirve el cuerpo de ancla y sostén en aguas turbulentas. Gracias a él no es arrastrado por las corrientes. Este Pokémon segrega un fuerte jugo digestivo a través de los tentáculos."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Cradily’s body serves as an anchor, preventing it from being washed away in rough seas. This Pokémon secretes a strong digestive fluid from its tentacles."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"体が 錘替わりに なっているので 海が 荒れても 流される ことは ない。 触手から 強い 消化液を 出す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il habitait généralement dans les hauts-fonds, mais parcourait le littoral en quête de proies lorsque la marée était basse."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Por lo general habitaba en las profundidades del mar y salía a tierra firme en busca de presas cuando bajaba la marea."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Normally, it lived on shallow sea shoals. When the tide went out, this Pokémon came up on land to search for prey."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"普段は 浅瀬の 海底に 棲み 潮が 引くと そのまま 陸に あがって 獲物を 探していた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Ce carnivore des mers antiques attrape sa proie à l’aide de ses huit tentacules, puis la dissout avec ses sucs digestifs."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Pokémon carnívoro de mares ancestrales. Con los ocho tentáculos atrapa a su presa y la come a medida que sus jugos gástricos la disuelven."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"This carnivorous Pokémon lived in primordial seas. It catches prey in its eight tentacles and dissolves them with digestive fluid as it eats."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"古代の海の 肉食ポケモン。 ８つの触手で 獲物を 捕らえ 消化液で 溶かしながら 食う。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il se déplace lentement avec ses petites pattes, mais il peut tripler la longueur de son cou et de ses tentacules pour capturer ses proies."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Sus cortas patas le impiden desplazarse con rapidez, pero puede triplicar la longitud de sus tentáculos y cuello para atrapar a presas lejanas."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It has short legs and can’t walk very fast, but its neck and tentacles can extend to over three times their usual length to nab distant prey."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"脚が 短く 歩みは 遅いが 首と 触手が ３倍 伸びて 遠くにいる 獲物を 捕まえる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il attrape ses proies à l’aide de ses tentacules, puis les dissout immédiatement avec ses sucs digestifs pour en absorber les nutriments."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Atrapa a sus presas con los tentáculos y enseguida las disuelve con sus jugos gástricos para absorber los nutrientes."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Once Cradily catches prey in its tentacles, it digests them whole and absorbs their nutrients."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"触手で 獲物を 捕まえると そのまま 消化液で 溶かして 栄養分を 吸収する。"}],"varieties":[{"id":346,"moves":[{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0]]},{"name":"bind","learns":[[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[